<title>INDIA: India's VSNL 1996/97 1st half net up.</title>
<headline>India's VSNL 1996/97 1st half net up.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	 2,648.0   vs     1,661.0</p>
<p>    Total income    25,051.0   vs    20,130.0</p>
<p>    Net sales	 24,721.0   vs    20,113.0</p>
<p>    Shr (in rupees)     66.0   vs	  51.0</p>
<p>    Gross Profit     4,673.0   vs     2,771.0</p>
<p>    Other income	 330.0   vs	  17.0</p>
<p>    Expenditure     20,348.0   vs    17,323.0</p>
<p>    Interest costs	30.0   vs	  36.0</p>
<p>    Depreciation	 300.0   vs	 250.0</p>
<p>    Tax		  1,725.0   vs	 860.0</p>
<p>Note: Indian telecom firm Videsh Sanchar Nigam Ltd (VSNL) said it handled 645 million minutes of telephone traffic against 533 million in the first half ended September 30, 1995.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom (91-22-265 9000)</p>
</text>
